 ## Background
-The method originates from practical implementations in raymarching and 3D visualization tools. [S1, unofficial] presents it in the context of a mesh-to-SDF tool, providing generic functions for camera transforms. [S2, unofficial] details its application in a LÖVE-based raymarcher, using spherical coordinates to allow user navigation. It is a standard technique in computer graphics for converting angular input into view matrices.
